OL,3,AUS judge orders Tennessee to preserve
OL,4,Aall evidence in Christa Pike's failed
OL,5,Aexecution
OL,6,
OL,7,FA judge says she will order Tennessee
OL,8,Fto preserve all evidence in Christa
OL,9,FPike's failed execution after her legal
OL,10,Fteam filed an emergency motion
OL,12,FLawyers for both Pike and the state
OL,13,Fhave been in court to discuss what will
OL,14,Fhappen next in her case and her legal
OL,15,Fteam is expected to give a news
OL,16,Fconference soon - watch live
OL,18,FPike's lawyer tells the court she is
OL,19,Fspeaking but limitedly after regaining
OL,20,Fconsciousness on Tuesday and that a
OL,21,Frequest by medical staff to have her
OL,22,Fshackles removed has been denied
